    "visual_brief": "Restrained flat editorial design; signal blue #2448DB, ink black #15191F, warm white #F3F2ED. Use the approved ICE / LOOP stacked wordmark with interwoven double O only as an unchanged supplied asset; never redraw the avatar. Use left-aligned large sans-serif Chinese titles, at most two lines, mono-style series labels, thin rules and generous whitespace. Cover: 2.35:1, 6% safe margins; title area about 60%, identity area about 30%. PY: warm-white background and blue identity; JV: ink-black background and warm-white identity; AI: warm-white background with sparse step markers; WK: signal-blue background and warm-white identity. Body diagrams: 4:3, clear reading order, short exact labels and mobile-readable type. No 3D, gradients, shadows, real product logos, cartoon robots, ice cubes or fake screenshots.",
    "image_style": "restrained flat editorial; no 3D, gradients or shadows"
  },
  "article": {
